Keep a shared edges as an empty list of whole numbers.
Place 1 into edges.
Place 3 into edges.
Place 0 into edges.
Place 3 into edges.
Place 0 into edges.
Place 2 into edges.
Keep a shared starts as an empty list of whole numbers.
Place 0 into starts.
Place 2 into starts.
Place 3 into starts.
Place 4 into starts.
Keep a shared counts as an empty list of whole numbers.
Place 2 into counts.
Place 1 into counts.
Place 1 into counts.
Place 2 into counts.
Keep a shared catdegrees as an empty list of whole numbers.
Place 0 into catdegrees.
Place 0 into catdegrees.
Place 0 into catdegrees.
Place 0 into catdegrees.
Keep a shared colors as an empty list of whole numbers.
For every spot from 0 to 31.
Place 0 into colors.

Keep a shared remaining as an empty list of whole numbers.
For every spot from 0 to 31.
Place 0 into remaining.

Keep a shared queue as an empty list of whole numbers.
Keep a shared count as 0.
Keep a shared champion as 0.
Keep a shared nowmouse as 0.
Keep a shared nowcat as 0.
Keep a shared nowturn as 0.
To relax from pred (a whole number) with winner (a whole number).
If item pred of colors is not 0, return.
The actor is pred modulo 2.
If actor is 0 and winner is 1, set item pred of colors to winner, Place pred into queue, add 1 to count, return.
If actor is 1 and winner is 2, set item pred of colors to winner, Place pred into queue, add 1 to count, return.
Set item pred of remaining to item pred of remaining minus 1.
If item pred of remaining is 0, set item pred of colors to winner, Place pred into queue, add 1 to count.

To catparents from mouse (a whole number) with cat (a whole number) and winner (a whole number).
The begin is item cat of starts.
The total is item cat of counts.
For every slot from begin to begin plus total minus 1.
The step is item slot of edges.
If step is not 0.
The pred is (mouse times 4 plus step) times 2 plus 1.
Relax from pred with winner.

To mouseparents from mouse (a whole number) with cat (a whole number) and winner (a whole number).
The begin is item mouse of starts.
The total is item mouse of counts.
For every slot from begin to begin plus total minus 1.
The step is item slot of edges.
If step is not 0 and step is not cat.
The pred is (step times 4 plus cat) times 2.
Relax from pred with winner.

For every cat from 1 to 3.
The begin is item cat of starts.
The total is item cat of counts.
For every slot from begin to begin plus total minus 1.
If item slot of edges is not 0, set item cat of catdegrees to item cat of catdegrees plus 1.

For every mouse from 0 to 3.
For every cat from 0 to 3.
For every turn from 0 to 1.
If mouse is 0, The index is (mouse times 4 plus cat) times 2 plus turn, set item index of colors to 1, Place index into queue, add 1 to count.

For every mouse from 0 to 3.
For every cat from 0 to 3.
For every turn from 0 to 1.
If mouse is more than 0 and mouse is cat, The index is (mouse times 4 plus cat) times 2 plus turn, set item index of colors to 2, Place index into queue, add 1 to count.

For every mouse from 1 to 3.
For every cat from 0 to 3.
For every turn from 0 to 1.
If mouse is not cat and cat is not 0.
The index is (mouse times 4 plus cat) times 2 plus turn.
If turn is 0, set item index of remaining to item mouse of counts.
If turn is 1, set item index of remaining to item cat of catdegrees.

The head is 0.
Repeat while head is less than count.
The state is item head of queue.
Add 1 to head.
Set champion to item state of colors.
Set nowmouse to state divided by 8.
The rest is state modulo 8.
Set nowcat to rest divided by 2.
Set nowturn to rest modulo 2.
If nowturn is 0, Catparents from nowmouse with nowcat and champion.
If nowturn is 1, Mouseparents from nowmouse with nowcat and champion.

The start is (1 times 4 plus 2) times 2.
Show item start of colors.
